      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Mr. Gabay, who has made an application for a loan under the Municipal Loan Program, is the Secretary of M&G Management Corporation, and is an officer, director or partner in Trio Film Effects, Inc. and Samuel Gabay Outlet, Inc., all of these listing 89 First Avenue, New York, N.Y. as their business address.",
